#: ../../source/community/meetings.rst:2
msgid "Community meetings"
msgstr "社区会议"

#: ../../source/community/meetings.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache hosts regular community meetings to discuss updates, address new "
"feature requests, and feedback from the community. If you are interested "
"in contributing to the LMCache projects (core LMCache or Production "
"Stack), we encourage you to join the meetings."
msgstr ""
"LMCache 定期举办社区会议，讨论更新、新功能请求以及社区反馈。如果您有兴趣为 "
"LMCache 项目（核心 LMCache 或 Production Stack）做出贡献，我们鼓励您参加这些会议。"

#: ../../source/community/meetings.rst:9
msgid "Meeting schedule"
msgstr "会议安排"

#: ../../source/community/meetings.rst:10
msgid "The LMCache community meetings held separately for each project:"
